[03:18.40][FINAL CHORUS — LUCIO + SAMANTHA | strong duet]
[03:18.40][SAMANTHA | female lead]
[03:18.40]Sotto la luce smeraldo,
[03:22.20]tra desiderio e controllo,
[03:25.60]il mio cuore corre troppo forte,
